==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10.67~18.67 seconds<sup>320f~560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~40 seconds<sup>300f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**6 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by upgrading the [[Worker Cat]]. When enemies come near the [[Cat Base]], spawn [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]]. When Those Guys appear, fire the [[Cat Cannon]] and spawn [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. Then start spamming your meatshields and slowly progress to the enemy base.

When the first Hippoe appears, send out meatshields occasionally to slow it down, and keep upgrading your Worker Cat. When Hippoe is near the Cat Base, fire your fully charged Cat Cannon once more and spawn [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] with meatshields. Use the money gained from defeating Hippoe to spam Axe Cats. If the second Hippoe appears, just repeat the same strategy. This stage will be much easier if you have the [[Energy Drink]] [[Treasure]].

An alternate strategy to beat this stage is to keep on spamming [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cats]], Tank Cats, and if you have enough money, a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]. No other cats are required.

