==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Kagawa Prefecture'''.
*The noodle dish on Kagawa Prefecture's base is [[wikipedia:Sanuki udon|Sanuki udon]], which gets its namesake from Kagawa's previous name, Sanuki Province. The prefecture is so synonymous with this dish that it has been nicknamed "Udon-ken" (Udon Prefecture).

